rvations, not engine frame boundaries. Paused means timeScale equals zero. Other mod entry points are outside this attribution. Body peaks sampled only on frame-status calls. GPU/CPU counters absent when unsupported. GC recorder is whole game, not attributed solely to this mod; an all-zero recorder without positive observations does not establish zero allocations."
